ent-ActionXenoTailStab = Tail Stab
    .desc = Stab a nearby target with your tail.
ent-ActionXenoLeap = Leap
    .desc = Leap toward a location and knock down nearby hosts.
ent-ActionXenoSpit = Acid Spit
    .desc = Spit acid at a target. Deals moderate damage on impact.
ent-ActionXenoSpitPraetorian = Acid Spit
    .desc = Spit concentrated acid at a target. Deals heavy damage on impact.
ent-ActionXenoSlowingSpit = Slowing Spit
    .desc = Spit neurotoxin that slows and briefly paralyzes the first enemy hit.
ent-ActionXenoCrest = Crest Defense
    .desc = Lower your crest to reduce incoming damage and resist knockdown, at the cost of speed.
ent-ActionXenoFortify = Fortify
    .desc = Dig in and become immobile. Greatly reduce damage taken; you cannot attack hosts.
ent-ActionXenoHeadbutt = Headbutt
    .desc = Charge into a target and knock them back.
ent-ActionXenoTailSweep = Tail Sweep
    .desc = Sweep your tail around you, knocking down nearby hosts.
ent-ActionXenoCharge = Charge
    .desc = Charge toward a location, knocking down hosts you smash into.
ent-ActionXenoPunch = Punch
    .desc = Punch a nearby host, knocking them back and slowing them.
ent-ActionXenoLunge = Lunge
    .desc = Lunge at a target, stun them, and drag them to you.
ent-ActionXenoFling = Fling
    .desc = Fling a nearby host away, stunning and slowing them.
ent-ActionXenoInvisibility = Cloak
    .desc = Cloak yourself from sight.
ent-ActionXenoScreech = Screech
    .desc = Unleash a stunning screech.
ent-ActionXenoPheromones = Emit Pheromones
    .desc = Emit a recovery aura that speeds nearby hive members.
ent-ActionXenoLayEgg = Lay Egg
    .desc = Stand on weeds and after 35 seconds lay a xenonid egg beneath you. Has a cooldown before you can lay again.
